<section id="production" class="card"><h2>🔧 Staff ROT & Production / TAT</h2><p class="muted">Productive time comes from technician segments; TAT is first start to end including pauses. Shared ROT work is not double-credited standard time. Efficiency is based only on completed single-technician ROTs; not a salary amount.</p>
